Herdr filter icon assets

Source: https://github.com/penso/herdr-gpui
Revision: aa1216ec6e88ca3224dee74cb1dcb22628b6145d
Upstream directory: assets/icons/

Source SVG paths are unchanged. sessions.svg is renamed workspace.svg,
terminal.svg is renamed shell.svg, and window-maximize.svg is renamed
session.svg. The color, mono-dark, and mono-light directories are generated
by ../generate_icons.py with explicit colors, consistent padding, and
rounded background tiles for the color set.

The status-working, status-waiting, status-idle, status-done, and
status-unknown sources are upstream status-outline-working,
status-outline-blocked, status-outline-idle, status-outline-done, and
status-outline-unknown respectively, also under Apache-2.0.

The agent-pi, agent-claude, agent-codex, agent-gemini, agent-cursor,
agent-devin, agent-agy, agent-cline, agent-mastracode, agent-opencode,
agent-copilot, agent-kimi, agent-kiro, agent-amp, agent-grok, agent-hermes,
agent-kilo, agent-qodercli, agent-qwen, and agent-muse SVGs derive from
https://github.com/lobehub/lobe-icons/tree/master/packages/static-svg/icons
under the MIT license below. Their source names respectively are pi,
claude, openai, gemini, cursor, devin, antigravity, cline, mastra, opencode,
githubcopilot, kimi, kiro, amp, grok, hermesagent, kilocode, qoder, qwen,
and meta. Upstream simplified SVG wrappers without changing the paths.
